<title>POLAND: BANK GDANSKI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 41.</title>
<headline>BANK GDANSKI TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 41.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 67,000 shares in Bank Gdanski at 41 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Bank Gdanski traded at 38 zlotys in a 4,307-share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
